msgstr "Berkas di folder lain dioptimalkan, dikirim lagi, atau dikembalikan, semuanya sekaligus."

#: includes/media/class-bulk.php:233
msgid "Iminify is still looking through your folders. Start again once it has finished."
msgstr "Iminify masih memeriksa folder Anda. Mulai lagi setelah selesai."

#: includes/media/class-bulk.php:251
msgid "The server is low on disk space. Free some up, then start again."
msgstr "Ruang disk server hampir habis. Kosongkan sebagian, lalu mulai lagi."

