msgstr "tidak berubah"

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:10
#, js-format
msgid "%s’s settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan %s"

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:11
#, js-format
msgid "Iminify found %s’s settings on this site. It can set this site’s settings to match them, as far as Iminify has the same settings: the compression level, the maximum width, metadata, WebP and AVIF copies, the sizes and backups. You see what changes before anything does."
msgstr "Iminify menemukan pengaturan %s di situs ini. Iminify dapat menyesuaikan pengaturan situs ini dengannya, sejauh Iminify memiliki pengaturan yang sama: tingkat kompresi, lebar maksimum, metadata, salinan WebP dan AVIF, ukuran, dan cadangan. Anda melihat apa saja yang berubah sebelum ada yang diubah."

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:12
#, js-format
msgid "Use %s’s settings"
msgstr "Gunakan pengaturan %s"

#: assets/build/settings.js:12
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Tidak, terima kasih"

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:13
#, js-format
msgid "This site already uses what %s’s settings match."
msgstr "Situs ini sudah menggunakan apa yang sesuai dengan pengaturan %s."

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:14
#, js-format
msgid "From %s’s settings, Iminify would set these. Nothing changes until you use them, and using them replaces the changes you haven’t saved in the settings below."
msgstr "Berdasarkan pengaturan %s, Iminify akan mengatur hal-hal ini. Tidak ada yang berubah sampai Anda menggunakannya, dan menggunakannya akan menggantikan perubahan yang belum Anda simpan di pengaturan di bawah."

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:15
#, js-format
msgid "From %s’s settings, Iminify would set these. Nothing changes until you use them."
msgstr "Berdasarkan pengaturan %s, Iminify akan mengatur hal-hal ini. Tidak ada yang berubah sampai Anda menggunakannya."

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:16
#, js-format
msgid "None of %s’s settings has a match in Iminify, so this site keeps its own."
msgstr "Tidak ada pengaturan %s yang memiliki padanan di Iminify, jadi situs ini mempertahankan pengaturannya sendiri."

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "Use these settings"
msgstr "Gunakan pengaturan ini"

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "OK"
msgstr "Oke"

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "Open the network's Iminify settings"
msgstr "Buka pengaturan Iminify jaringan"

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "The network's connection"
msgstr "Koneksi jaringan"

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "This is the network's main site, so it uses the network's connection to Iminify. A super admin connects and disconnects the network in the network admin."
msgstr "Ini situs utama jaringan, jadi situs ini memakai koneksi jaringan ke Iminify. Admin super menghubungkan dan memutuskan koneksi jaringan di admin jaringan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "This is the network's main site, so it uses the network's connection to Iminify, which isn't made yet. A super admin connects the network in the network admin, and every site joins it by itself."
msgstr "Ini situs utama jaringan, jadi situs ini memakai koneksi jaringan ke Iminify, yang belum dibuat. Admin super menghubungkan jaringan di admin jaringan, dan setiap situs bergabung dengan sendirinya."

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "The network's sites"
msgstr "Situs-situs jaringan"

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "This key was made for a single site, so the network's sites can't join with it. Disconnect, then connect the network again, or make a key under Settings, Sites on iminify.com with This is a multisite network ticked."
msgstr "Kunci ini dibuat untuk satu situs, jadi situs-situs dalam jaringan tidak dapat bergabung dengannya. Putuskan koneksi, lalu hubungkan jaringan lagi, atau buat kunci di Settings, Sites di iminify.com dengan This is a multisite network dicentang."

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "Each site of the network joins by itself the first time it needs Iminify, with a key of its own, and starts with the main site's settings. Each counts as a site of its own on your account. A site disconnected on its own page, or under Settings, Sites on iminify.com, doesn't join again by itself."
msgstr "Setiap situs di jaringan bergabung dengan sendirinya saat pertama kali membutuhkan Iminify, dengan kuncinya sendiri, dan dimulai dengan pengaturan situs utama. Setiap situs dihitung sebagai situs tersendiri di akun Anda. Situs yang diputus koneksinya di lamannya sendiri, atau di Settings, Sites di iminify.com, tidak bergabung lagi dengan sendirinya."

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "Each site's settings are on its own Settings, Iminify page. The images in themes and other folders are the main site's to optimize, once for the whole network."
msgstr "Pengaturan setiap situs ada di laman Pengaturan, Iminify miliknya sendiri. Gambar di tema dan folder lain dioptimalkan oleh situs utama, sekali untuk seluruh jaringan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "The main site's settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan situs utama"

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "The main site's other folders"
msgstr "Folder lain situs utama"

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
msgid "How a network connects"
msgstr "Cara jaringan terhubung"

#: assets/build/settings.js:16
#: assets/build/settings.js:17
msgid "Join the network"
msgstr "Gabung ke jaringan"

#. translators: %s: the network's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:17
#, js-format
msgid "%s is connected to Iminify. This site can join it with a key of its own, and counts as a site of its own on the account."
msgstr "%s terhubung ke Iminify. Situs ini dapat bergabung dengan kuncinya sendiri, dan dihitung sebagai situs tersendiri di akun."

#: assets/build/settings.js:17
msgid "In WordPress’s rewrite rules:"
msgstr "Di aturan penulisan ulang WordPress:"

#: assets/build/settings.js:17
msgid "In <file />:"
msgstr "Di <file />:"

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:18
#, js-format
msgid "Take %s’s rule out of WordPress’s rewrite rules? Every other rule stays."
msgstr "Hapus aturan %s dari aturan penulisan ulang WordPress? Semua aturan lainnya tetap ada."

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:19
#, js-format
msgid "Remove %s’s lines from this file? Everything else in it stays as it is. Nginx keeps them until it is reloaded, so reload it afterwards."
msgstr "Hapus baris %s dari berkas ini? Semua isi lainnya tetap apa adanya. Nginx tetap memakainya sampai dimuat ulang, jadi muat ulang Nginx setelahnya."

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:20
#, js-format
msgid "Remove %s’s lines from this file? Everything else in it stays as it is."
msgstr "Hapus baris %s dari berkas ini? Semua isi lainnya tetap apa adanya."

#. translators: %s: the first line of another plugin's block, such as "# BEGIN EWWWIO".
#: assets/build/settings.js:21
#, js-format
msgid "<file /> holds the line %s, but the block it starts has no end of its own, or runs across another block, so the plugin leaves the file alone. Remove the block’s lines by hand."
msgstr "<file /> memuat baris %s, tetapi blok yang dimulainya tidak memiliki akhir sendiri, atau melintasi blok lain, jadi plugin tidak mengubah berkas itu. Hapus baris-baris blok tersebut secara manual."

#: assets/build/settings.js:21
msgid "The plugin can’t write to <file />. Remove these lines from it by hand, then reload Nginx."
msgstr "Plugin tidak dapat menulis ke <file />. Hapus baris-baris ini darinya secara manual, lalu muat ulang Nginx."

#: assets/build/settings.js:21
msgid "The plugin can’t write to <file />. Remove these lines from it by hand."
msgstr "Plugin tidak dapat menulis ke <file />. Hapus baris-baris ini darinya secara manual."

#: assets/build/settings.js:21
msgid "Every site of the network shares these lines, so someone who can manage the network removes them, from the network admin’s Iminify settings."
msgstr "Semua situs di jaringan memakai baris-baris ini bersama, jadi baris-baris ini dihapus oleh orang yang dapat mengelola jaringan, dari pengaturan Iminify di admin jaringan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:21
msgid "Every site of the network shares these lines, so a super admin removes them, on this page."
msgstr "Semua situs di jaringan memakai baris-baris ini bersama, jadi baris-baris ini dihapus oleh admin super, di laman ini."

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:22
#, js-format
msgid "%s’s rewrite rule"
msgstr "Aturan penulisan ulang %s"

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:23
#, js-format
msgid "%s’s rules"
msgstr "Aturan %s"

#: assets/build/settings.js:23
msgid "Rules another optimizer left"
msgstr "Aturan yang ditinggalkan pengoptimal lain"

#: assets/build/settings.js:23
msgid "The rules another optimizer left are gone."
msgstr "Aturan yang ditinggalkan pengoptimal lain sudah dihapus."

#: assets/build/settings.js:23
msgid "An image optimizer you had before left these rules behind when it was switched off. Iminify never removes another plugin’s rules by itself."
msgstr "Pengoptimal gambar yang Anda pakai sebelumnya meninggalkan aturan ini saat dimatikan. Iminify tidak pernah menghapus aturan plugin lain dengan sendirinya."

#. translators: %d: how many images.
#: assets/build/settings.js:24
#, js-format
msgid "%d image is being optimized."
msgid_plural "%d images are being optimized."
msgstr[0] "%d gambar sedang dioptimalkan."
msgstr[1] "%d gambar sedang dioptimalkan."

#. translators: %d: how many images.
#: assets/build/settings.js:25
#, js-format
msgid "%d image is waiting for the next batch."
msgid_plural "%d images are waiting for the next batch."
msgstr[0] "%d gambar menunggu jatah berikutnya."
msgstr[1] "%d gambar menunggu jatah berikutnya."

#. translators: %d: how many images.
#: assets/build/settings.js:26
#, js-format
msgid "%d image is waiting for the site to be connected. It goes out by itself once it is."
msgid_plural "%d images are waiting for the site to be connected. They go out by themselves once it is."
msgstr[0] "%d gambar menunggu situs terhubung. Gambar dikirim otomatis setelah situs terhubung."
msgstr[1] "%d gambar menunggu situs terhubung. Gambar dikirim otomatis setelah situs terhubung."

#. translators: %s: the date and time the next batch opens.
#: assets/build/settings.js:27
#, js-format
msgid "The next batch opens on %s. New uploads go first, by themselves."
msgstr "Jatah berikutnya dibuka pada %s. Unggahan baru diproses lebih dulu, secara otomatis."

#: assets/build/settings.js:27
msgid "Queue"
msgstr "Antrean"

#: assets/build/settings.js:27
msgid "The server is low on disk space, so Iminify has stopped optimizing images here. Free some up, then optimize the images marked \"Not optimized\"."
msgstr "Ruang disk server hampir habis, jadi Iminify berhenti mengoptimalkan gambar di sini. Kosongkan sebagian, lalu optimalkan gambar yang ditandai \"Belum dioptimalkan\"."

#: assets/build/settings.js:27
msgid "Your server answered with an error once the rules were in, so the plugin took them out again and your images load as before. Ask your host whether .htaccess files may set rewrite rules and file types, or choose picture tags."
msgstr "Server Anda menjawab dengan eror setelah aturan dipasang, jadi plugin menghapusnya lagi dan gambar Anda dimuat seperti sebelumnya. Tanyakan kepada penyedia hosting Anda apakah berkas .htaccess boleh mengatur aturan penulisan ulang dan jenis berkas, atau pilih tag picture."

#. translators: %s: the date and time of the last check.
#: assets/build/settings.js:28
#, js-format
msgid "Your server sends the WebP and AVIF copies. Checked %s."
msgstr "Server Anda mengirimkan salinan WebP dan AVIF. Diperiksa %s."

#. translators: %s: the date and time of the last check.
#: assets/build/settings.js:30
#, js-format
msgid "Your server still sends the originals: something answers for images before these rules are read, often Nginx in front of Apache. Add the Nginx lines below to its configuration, or choose picture tags. Checked %s."
msgstr "Server Anda masih mengirimkan versi asli: ada yang menjawab permintaan gambar sebelum aturan ini dibaca, sering kali Nginx di depan Apache. Tambahkan baris Nginx di bawah ke konfigurasinya, atau pilih tag picture. Diperiksa %s."

#. translators: %s: the date and time of the last check.
#: assets/build/settings.js:32
#, js-format
msgid "Your server still sends the originals. Add the lines below to its configuration and reload Nginx, then save again. Checked %s."
msgstr "Server Anda masih mengirimkan versi asli. Tambahkan baris di bawah ke konfigurasinya dan muat ulang Nginx, lalu simpan lagi. Diperiksa %s."

#. translators: %s: the date and time of the last check.
#: assets/build/settings.js:34
#, js-format
msgid "Cloudflare answered with the original, so a visitor may never get a copy through these rules. Choose picture tags, which work behind Cloudflare. Checked %s."
msgstr "Cloudflare menjawab dengan versi asli, jadi pengunjung mungkin tidak pernah mendapat salinan melalui aturan ini. Pilih tag picture, yang berfungsi di balik Cloudflare. Diperiksa %s."

#. translators: %s: the date and time of the last check.
#: assets/build/settings.js:35
#, js-format
msgid "The plugin couldn't ask your site for an image to see whether the rules work, which happens when a site can't reach its own address. Open one of your images with a browser's developer tools: its type should read image/avif or image/webp. Tried %s."
msgstr "Plugin tidak dapat meminta gambar dari situs Anda untuk melihat apakah aturan berfungsi, yang terjadi bila situs tidak dapat menjangkau alamatnya sendiri. Buka salah satu gambar Anda dengan alat pengembang peramban: jenisnya seharusnya image/avif atau image/webp. Dicoba %s."

#: assets/build/settings.js:35
msgid "The rules are in <file />."
msgstr "Aturan sudah ada di <file />."

#. translators: <file /> is the file's path, <begin /> and <end /> the first and last lines of the plugin's block in it (such as "# BEGIN Iminify"), <closing /> the line </IfModule>.
#: assets/build/settings.js:36
msgid "<file /> holds the line <begin /> without its <end /> line, so the plugin leaves the file alone. Put the line <end /> back after the block’s last <closing />, or delete every line of the block, then save again."
msgstr "<file /> memuat baris <begin /> tanpa baris <end />, jadi plugin tidak mengubah berkas itu. Tambahkan lagi baris <end /> setelah <closing /> terakhir blok tersebut, atau hapus setiap baris blok itu, lalu simpan lagi."

#: assets/build/settings.js:36
msgid "Your uploads folder isn't inside the folder that holds the site's .htaccess file, so no rule there can name it. Choose picture tags."
msgstr "Folder unggahan Anda tidak berada di dalam folder yang memuat berkas .htaccess situs, jadi tidak ada aturan di sana yang dapat menjangkaunya. Pilih tag picture."

#: assets/build/settings.js:36
msgid "There’s no <file /> yet. Create it with these lines, then save again."
msgstr "Belum ada <file />. Buat berkas itu dengan baris-baris ini, lalu simpan lagi."

#: assets/build/settings.js:36
msgid "<file /> doesn’t turn on rewriting, so the plugin leaves it alone. If your server reads rewrite rules there, paste these lines into it, then save again."
msgstr "<file /> tidak mengaktifkan penulisan ulang, jadi plugin tidak mengubahnya. Jika server Anda membaca aturan penulisan ulang di sana, tempel baris-baris ini ke dalamnya, lalu simpan lagi."

#: assets/build/settings.js:36
msgid "The plugin can’t write to <file />. Paste these lines into it, above the rules WordPress gave the network, then save again."
msgstr "Plugin tidak dapat menulis ke <file />. Tempel baris-baris ini ke dalamnya, di atas aturan yang diberikan WordPress untuk jaringan, lalu simpan lagi."

#: assets/build/settings.js:36
msgid "The plugin can’t write to <file />. Paste these lines at its end, then save again."
msgstr "Plugin tidak dapat menulis ke <file />. Tempel baris-baris ini di bagian akhirnya, lalu simpan lagi."

#: assets/build/settings.js:36
msgid "Your server reads neither .htaccess files nor Nginx's configuration, so the plugin has no rules to give it. Choose picture tags."
msgstr "Server Anda tidak membaca berkas .htaccess maupun konfigurasi Nginx, jadi plugin tidak memiliki aturan untuk diberikan. Pilih tag picture."

#: assets/build/settings.js:36
msgid "Your site runs on Nginx, which doesn't read .htaccess. Put the first lines at the top of the site's server block, before any if or rewrite, and the location above any other location for images, then reload Nginx. Copy into the location any expires, Cache-Control or add_header lines your images need, since its add_header replaces the server block's:"
msgstr "Situs Anda berjalan di Nginx, yang tidak membaca .htaccess. Letakkan baris-baris pertama di bagian atas blok server situs, sebelum if atau rewrite apa pun, dan location di atas location lain untuk gambar, lalu muat ulang Nginx. Salin ke dalam location tersebut baris expires, Cache-Control, atau add_header yang dibutuhkan gambar Anda, karena add_header miliknya menggantikan milik blok server:"

#: assets/build/settings.js:36
msgid "For Nginx, put the first lines at the top of the site's server block, before any if or rewrite, and the location above any other location for images, then reload Nginx. Copy into the location any expires, Cache-Control or add_header lines your images need, since its add_header replaces the server block's:"
msgstr "Untuk Nginx, letakkan baris-baris pertama di bagian atas blok server situs, sebelum if atau rewrite apa pun, dan location di atas location lain untuk gambar, lalu muat ulang Nginx. Salin ke dalam location tersebut baris expires, Cache-Control, atau add_header yang dibutuhkan gambar Anda, karena add_header miliknya menggantikan milik blok server:"

#. translators: %s: the folders the rules cover, separated by commas.
#: assets/build/settings.js:37
#, js-format
msgid "They cover: %s."
msgstr "Aturan ini mencakup: %s."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "They serve any WebP or AVIF copy named after an image beside it, so a copy another optimizer left there is served too until Iminify makes its own. Iminify never deletes another plugin’s copies."
msgstr "Aturan ini menyajikan salinan WebP atau AVIF apa pun yang dinamai sesuai gambar di sampingnya, jadi salinan yang ditinggalkan pengoptimal lain di sana juga disajikan sampai Iminify membuat salinannya sendiri. Iminify tidak pernah menghapus salinan milik plugin lain."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Cloudflare answers for your site. It keeps one version of each image whatever the browser reads, so a browser that can't show AVIF could get the AVIF copy. Choose picture tags, which work behind any CDN."
msgstr "Cloudflare menjawab untuk situs Anda. Cloudflare menyimpan satu versi setiap gambar, apa pun yang dapat dibaca peramban, jadi peramban yang tidak dapat menampilkan AVIF bisa mendapat salinan AVIF. Pilih tag picture, yang berfungsi di balik CDN apa pun."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "WP Offload Media serves your images from its bucket, which these rules never reach, so those keep their originals. With its “Remove Local Media” on, the rules serve nothing."
msgstr "WP Offload Media menyajikan gambar Anda dari bucket-nya, yang tidak pernah dijangkau aturan ini, jadi gambar-gambar itu tetap memakai versi aslinya. Jika “Remove Local Media” miliknya aktif, aturan ini tidak menyajikan apa pun."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Also reaches the images in raw HTML, page builders and your theme's own markup, the backgrounds set in the page itself, and the images in the folders you chose, by reading each page as it's sent. A background set in a stylesheet file keeps its original. A page your cache hasn't kept takes a little longer."
msgstr "Juga menjangkau gambar di HTML mentah, page builder, dan markup tema Anda sendiri, latar belakang yang diatur di dalam laman itu sendiri, serta gambar di folder yang Anda pilih, dengan membaca setiap laman saat dikirim. Latar belakang yang diatur di berkas stylesheet tetap memakai versi aslinya. Laman yang belum disimpan cache Anda membutuhkan waktu sedikit lebih lama."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Your pages stay as they are, and your server sends the WebP or AVIF copy in place of the image to each browser that reads it. That reaches every image in the uploads folder and the folders you chose, backgrounds in stylesheet files too. Needs rules in your server’s configuration, written for you on Apache, and behind a CDN, one that keeps a version of each image per format."
msgstr "Laman Anda tetap apa adanya, dan server Anda mengirimkan salinan WebP atau AVIF sebagai pengganti gambar ke setiap peramban yang dapat membacanya. Ini menjangkau setiap gambar di folder unggahan dan folder yang Anda pilih, termasuk latar belakang di berkas stylesheet. Memerlukan aturan di konfigurasi server Anda, yang ditulis untuk Anda di Apache, dan jika di balik CDN, CDN yang menyimpan versi setiap gambar per format."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Your pages stay as they are: the copies are made, but no page names them."
msgstr "Laman Anda tetap apa adanya: salinan dibuat, tetapi tidak ada laman yang menggunakannya."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "For the images in your posts and those your theme shows through WordPress. Each page is the same for every visitor, so page caches and CDNs keep working, and a browser that reads neither format gets the original."
msgstr "Untuk gambar di pos Anda dan gambar yang ditampilkan tema Anda melalui WordPress. Setiap laman sama untuk setiap pengunjung, jadi cache laman dan CDN tetap berfungsi, dan peramban yang tidak dapat membaca kedua format tersebut mendapat versi asli."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Optimization"
msgstr "Pengoptimalan"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "These settings are kept with the site on iminify.com, which applies them to every image the site sends."
msgstr "Pengaturan ini disimpan bersama situs di iminify.com, yang menerapkannya pada setiap gambar yang dikirim situs."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Send each image to Iminify as it is uploaded."
msgstr "Kirim setiap gambar ke Iminify saat diunggah."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "A WebP copy of every size, served to browsers that read it. A copy larger than its image isn't kept."
msgstr "Salinan WebP dari setiap ukuran, disajikan ke peramban yang dapat membacanya. Salinan yang lebih besar dari gambarnya tidak disimpan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "An AVIF copy of every size too: usually smaller than WebP, and slower to make."
msgstr "Salinan AVIF dari setiap ukuran juga: biasanya lebih kecil dari WebP, dan lebih lambat dibuat."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Any width"
msgstr "Lebar berapa pun"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Shrinks a wider main image to this width. Leave it empty to keep each image's width."
msgstr "Memperkecil gambar utama yang lebih lebar ke lebar ini. Biarkan kosong untuk mempertahankan lebar setiap gambar."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Fits the main image under this size. Leave it empty for no limit."
msgstr "Memperkecil gambar utama hingga di bawah batas ini. Biarkan kosong agar tanpa batas."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Keeps each image's EXIF data, such as the camera and the place it was taken. Off removes it."
msgstr "Mempertahankan data EXIF setiap gambar, seperti kamera dan tempat gambar itu diambil. Jika nonaktif, data itu dihapus."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Describes each image that has no alt text. An alt text you wrote is never replaced. A small copy of the image goes to Anthropic's AI, and each one counts against your AI alt texts for the day."
msgstr "Mendeskripsikan setiap gambar yang tidak memiliki teks alt. Teks alt yang Anda tulis tidak pernah diganti. Versi kecil gambar dikirim ke AI Anthropic, dan setiap gambar dihitung dalam kuota teks alt AI Anda hari ini."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Language of the alt text"
msgstr "Bahasa teks alt"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Optimize every size"
msgstr "Optimalkan semua ukuran"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Every size WordPress makes of an upload. Turn it off to pick the sizes."
msgstr "Setiap ukuran yang dibuat WordPress dari unggahan. Matikan untuk memilih ukurannya."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "On this site"
msgstr "Di situs ini"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Kept in the uploads folder under iminify-backup, so any image can be restored as it was."
msgstr "Disimpan di folder unggahan di bawah iminify-backup, jadi gambar apa pun dapat dikembalikan seperti semula."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "WebP and AVIF on your pages"
msgstr "WebP dan AVIF di laman Anda"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Serve them with picture tags"
msgstr "Sajikan dengan tag picture"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Serve them on the whole page"
msgstr "Sajikan di seluruh laman"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Serve them through server rules"
msgstr "Sajikan melalui aturan server"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Don't change the pages"
msgstr "Jangan ubah laman"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Add the width, height and alt text images lack"
msgstr "Tambahkan lebar, tinggi, dan teks alt yang kurang pada gambar"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Where a page’s markup leaves them out of an image from your media library, the plugin adds its width and height, so the page doesn’t jump as it loads, and the alt text it has in the library, as each page is sent. An alt text left empty on purpose stays empty."
msgstr "Jika markup laman tidak menyertakannya pada gambar dari pustaka media Anda, plugin menambahkan lebar dan tingginya, agar laman tidak bergeser saat dimuat, serta teks alt yang dimilikinya di pustaka, saat setiap laman dikirim. Teks alt yang sengaja dikosongkan tetap kosong."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "When you delete the plugin"
msgstr "Saat Anda menghapus plugin"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Also delete the WebP and AVIF copies"
msgstr "Hapus juga salinan WebP dan AVIF"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "A page your cache kept with picture tags would show a broken image until the cache is cleared."
msgstr "Laman yang disimpan cache Anda dengan tag picture akan menampilkan gambar rusak sampai cache dibersihkan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Also delete the backups"
msgstr "Hapus juga cadangannya"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "They're the only originals of the images Iminify optimized, so those images can't be restored afterwards. With the copies deleted too, installing the plugin again would optimize those images a second time."
msgstr "Cadangan adalah satu-satunya versi asli gambar yang dioptimalkan Iminify, jadi gambar-gambar itu tidak dapat dikembalikan setelahnya. Jika salinannya juga dihapus, memasang plugin lagi akan mengoptimalkan gambar-gambar itu untuk kedua kalinya."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Simpan Perubahan"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "Perubahan belum disimpan"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Needs attention"
msgstr "Perlu perhatian"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "The network is connected."
msgstr "Jaringan sudah terhubung."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "The site is connected."
msgstr "Situs sudah terhubung."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "The connection wasn't approved in time, or was turned down. Press Connect the network to try again."
msgstr "Koneksi tidak disetujui tepat waktu, atau ditolak. Tekan Hubungkan jaringan untuk mencoba lagi."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "The connection wasn't approved in time, or was turned down. Press Connect to try again."
msgstr "Koneksi tidak disetujui tepat waktu, atau ditolak. Tekan Hubungkan untuk mencoba lagi."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "The network is disconnected here, but its key couldn't be stopped on Iminify. Disconnect it under Settings, Sites on iminify.com too."
msgstr "Koneksi jaringan sudah diputus di sini, tetapi kuncinya tidak dapat dihentikan di Iminify. Putuskan juga koneksinya di Settings, Sites di iminify.com."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "The site is disconnected here, but its key couldn't be stopped on Iminify. Disconnect it under Settings, Sites on iminify.com too."
msgstr "Koneksi situs sudah diputus di sini, tetapi kuncinya tidak dapat dihentikan di Iminify. Putuskan juga koneksinya di Settings, Sites di iminify.com."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "The site joined the network."
msgstr "Situs sudah bergabung ke jaringan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Move the connection here"
msgstr "Pindahkan koneksi ke sini"

#: assets/build/settings.js:37
msgid "Connect this copy as its own site"
msgstr "Hubungkan salinan ini sebagai situs tersendiri"

#. translators: %s: another image optimizer's name.
#: assets/build/settings.js:38
#, js-format
msgid "This site now uses %s’s settings."
msgstr "Situs ini kini menggunakan pengaturan %s."

#: assets/build/settings.js:38
msgid "The lines are removed. Reload Nginx so it stops serving them."
msgstr "Baris-baris itu sudah dihapus. Muat ulang Nginx agar berhenti menyajikannya."

#: assets/build/settings.js:38
msgid "The lines are removed."
msgstr "Baris-baris itu sudah dihapus."

#: assets/build/settings.js:38
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Pengaturan telah disimpan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:38
msgid "The images waiting are on their way."
msgstr "Gambar yang menunggu sedang dikirim."

#: assets/build/settings.js:38
msgid "Your account's images for the day are still used up."
msgstr "Kuota gambar harian akun Anda masih habis."

#: assets/build/settings.js:38
msgid "Iminify disconnected the network, so new uploads on its sites aren't optimized. Connect it again to carry on."
msgstr "Iminify memutuskan koneksi jaringan, jadi unggahan baru di situs-situsnya tidak dioptimalkan. Hubungkan lagi untuk melanjutkan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:38
msgid "Iminify disconnected the network, so new uploads aren't optimized. A super admin connects it again in the network admin."
msgstr "Iminify memutuskan koneksi jaringan, jadi unggahan baru tidak dioptimalkan. Admin super menghubungkannya lagi di admin jaringan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:38
msgid "Iminify disconnected this site, so new uploads aren't optimized. Join the network again, or connect the site on its own, to carry on."
msgstr "Iminify memutuskan koneksi situs ini, jadi unggahan baru tidak dioptimalkan. Gabung ke jaringan lagi, atau hubungkan situs ini secara tersendiri, untuk melanjutkan."

#: assets/build/settings.js:38
msgid "Iminify disconnected this site, so new uploads aren't optimized. Connect it again to carry on."
msgstr "Iminify memutuskan koneksi situs ini, jadi unggahan baru tidak dioptimalkan. Hubungkan lagi untuk melanjutkan."
